gjin:m008-0000","chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p008","quote":"淮南"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0000","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p020","quote":"王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0010","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p020","quote":"王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0014","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p020","quote":"王"},{"kind":"table_cell","table_id":"shiji-019","table_cell_id":"shiji-019-t3-r018-c02","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-019","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-019","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-019","source_revision":"6359260","mention_id":"shiji-019-t3-r018-c02-m000","quote":"劉安","source_quote":"八。八年五月丙午，侯劉安元年。十六年，安爲淮南王，國除。"},{"kind":"table_cell","table_id":"shiji-019","table_cell_id":"shiji-019-t3-r018-c02","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-019","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-019","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-019","source_revision":"6359260","mention_id":"shiji-019-t3-r018-c02-m001","quote":"安","source_quote":"八。八年五月丙午，侯劉安元年。十六年，安爲淮南王，國除。"},{"kind":"table_cell","table_id":"shiji-017","table_cell_id":"shiji-017-t1-r043-c13","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-017","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-017","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-017","source_revision":"2607010","mention_id":"shiji-017-t1-r043-c13-m000","quote":"安","source_quote":"四月丙寅，王安元年。淮南厲王子，故阜陵侯。"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m014-0047","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p014","quote":"王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m014-0066","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p014","quote":"王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-120-jizheng:m009-0000","chapter_id":"c-shiji-120-jizheng","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-120-jizheng:p009","quote":"淮南王"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AF","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","source_id":"s-shiji118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p011","quote":"孝文八年，上憐淮南王，淮南王有子四人，皆七八歲，乃封子安為阜陵侯，子勃為安陽侯，子賜為陽周侯，子良為東成侯。"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji118-003","interpretation_note":"未發布來源候選依明示父子共享家族根；分支槽不表示出生排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},"identity_note":"傅偃案及魏其篇武安侯霸上迎王、厚遺金財物與淮南衡山篇互見，採劉長子安同人；父子、祖孫各依原主張，未核書影。","evidence_scope":"corpus_and_native_table_mentions"},{"id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFAB","label":"不害（淮南衡山列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"不害","mention_ids":["c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0004","c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0029","c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0195"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0004","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p020","quote":"不害"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0029","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p020","quote":"不害"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0195","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p020","quote":"不害"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFA","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","source_id":"s-shiji118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p020","quote":"王有孽子不害，最長，王弗愛，王、王后、太子皆不以為子兄數。不害有子建，材高有氣，常怨望太子不省其父；又怨時諸侯皆得分子弟為侯，而淮南獨二子，一為太子，建父獨不得為侯。建陰結交，欲告敗太子，以其父代之。太子知之，數捕繋而榜笞建。建具知太子之謀欲殺漢中尉，即使所善壽春莊芷以元朔六年上書於天子曰：「毒藥苦於口利於病，忠言逆於耳利於行。今淮南王孫建，材能高，淮南王王后荼、荼子太子遷常疾害建。建父不害無罪，擅數捕繋，欲殺之。今建在，可徵問，具知淮南陰事。」書聞，上以其事下廷尉，廷尉下河南治。是時故辟陽侯孫審卿善丞相公孫弘，怨淮南厲王殺其大父，乃深購淮南事於弘，弘乃疑淮南有畔逆計謀，深窮治其獄。河南治建，辭引淮南太子及黨與。淮南王患之，欲發，問伍被曰：「漢廷治亂？」伍被曰：「天下治。」王意不說，謂伍被曰：「公何以言天下治也？」被曰：「被竊觀朝廷之政，君臣之義，父子之親，夫婦之別，長幼之序，皆得其理，上之舉錯遵古之道，風俗紀綱未有所缺也。重裝富賈，周流天下，道無不通，故交易之道行。南越賓服，羌僰入獻，東甌入降，廣長榆，開朔方，匈奴折翅傷翼，失援不振。雖未及古太平之時，然猶為治也。」王怒，被謝死罪。王又謂被曰：「山東即有兵，漢必使大將軍將而制山東，公以為大將軍何如人也？」被曰：「被所善者黃義，從大將軍擊匈奴，還，告被曰：『大將軍遇士大夫有禮，於士卒有恩，眾皆樂為之用。騎上下山若蜚，材干絕人。』被以為材能如此，數將習兵，未易當也。及謁者曹梁使長安來，言大將軍號令明，當敵勇敢，常為士卒先。休舍，穿井未通，須士卒盡得水，乃敢飲。軍罷，卒盡已度河，乃度。皇太后所賜金帛，盡以賜軍吏。雖古名將弗過也。」王默然。"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji118-010","interpretation_note":"未發布來源候選依明示父子共享家族根；分支槽不表示出生排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}},{"id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFABA","label":"建（不害子）（淮南衡山列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"建","mention_ids":["c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0033","c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0075","c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0083","c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0111","c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0113","c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0191","c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0193","c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0210","c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0298","c-shiji-118-huainan:m021-0004"]},{"surface":"淮南王孫建","mention_ids":["c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0166"]},{"surface":"王孫建","mention_ids":["c-shiji-118-huainan:m023-0005"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0033","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p020","quote":"建"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0075","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p020","quote":"建"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0083","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p020","quote":"建"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0111","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p020","quote":"建"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0113","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p020","quote":"建"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0166","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p020","quote":"淮南王孫建"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0191","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p020","quote":"建"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0193","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p020","quote":"